---
title: StoreOS v1 Architecture
---
flowchart TD
    U([Seller / team member]) --> MW[Next.js middleware<br/>Supabase session refresh, protects /app]
    MW --> RSC[Server Components<br/>/app modules]
    RSC --> SA[Server Actions<br/>zod validation]
    SA --> SB[(Supabase Postgres<br/>RLS by workspace membership)]
    RSC --> SB
    U -->|image upload| ST[(Supabase Storage<br/>product-images/&lt;workspace&gt;/)]

    subgraph Support pipeline
        M([Customer message<br/>WhatsApp / IG / email]) --> C[Classify<br/>intent, urgency, sentiment]
        C --> X[Context<br/>customer, orders, catalogue]
        X --> D[Draft reply + action]
        D --> P{Server-side policy<br/>refund limits, sentiment,<br/>urgency, confidence}
        P -->|low risk + auto-send| S[Post reply]
        P -->|otherwise| A[Approvals queue]
        A -->|owner/admin + rationale| S
    end

    SA --> C
    C & D -.-> AI[(OpenAI-compatible LLM<br/>Gemini default · Qwen alt<br/>demo rules when no key)]
    S --> SB
    A --> SB
    P --> LOG[(ai_decisions + audit_events)]
